{"seq":1,"slug":"node-cli-architecture","title":"Node CLI 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/nodejs-cli/node-cli-architecture","wordCount":625,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"node-cli-架构\">Node CLI 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Node.js CLI 架构</strong>指的是把一份 Node 源码变成一个可全局调用的命令所需的组织方式。核心是三个机制：用 <code>bin</code> 字段注册命令入口、用 shebang 声明解释器、用模块系统组织代码。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>命令注册</td>\n<td><code>package.json</code> 的 <code>bin</code></td>\n<td>安装时链接到系统 PATH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可执行入口</td>\n<td><code>#!/usr/bin/env node</code></td>\n<td>让文件被 shell 直接执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码组织</td>\n<td>ESM（<code>type: module</code>）</td>\n<td>模块划分与依赖导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工程约束</td>\n<td><code>files</code>、<code>engines</code>、tsconfig</td>\n<td>控制发布内容与运行环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条贯穿的原则：<strong>入口文件只做编排</strong>（解析参数、调度模块），具体逻辑放在可单测的模块里。本文从 <code>bin</code> 字段讲到 shebang、ESM 组织与项目结构。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"package-json-的-bin-字段\">Package.json 的 bin 字段</h2><p>Node.js CLI 工具的入口通过 <strong>package.json</strong> 的 <code>bin</code> 字段注册。npm 在安装时会将指定的脚本文件链接到系统 PATH 中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;devtool&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;,&#10;  &quot;bin&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;devtool&quot;: &quot;./dist/cli.mjs&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: [&quot;dist&quot;],&#10;  &quot;engines&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;node&quot;: &quot;&gt;=18.0.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"devtool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"devtool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/cli.mjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"engines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\">=18.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>bin 配置方式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单命令</td>\n<td><code>&quot;bin&quot;: &quot;./cli.mjs&quot;</code></td>\n<td>命令名 = 包名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命名命令</td>\n<td><code>&quot;bin&quot;: { &quot;dt&quot;: &quot;./cli.mjs&quot; }</code></td>\n<td>命令名 = dt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多命令</td>\n<td><code>&quot;bin&quot;: { &quot;dt&quot;: &quot;...&quot;, &quot;dtx&quot;: &quot;...&quot; }</code></td>\n<td>注册多个命令</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[npm install -g devtool] --&gt; B[读取 package.json]&#10;    B --&gt; C[获取 bin 字段]&#10;    C --&gt; D[创建符号链接]&#10;    D --&gt; E[devtool → dist/cli.mjs]&#10;    E --&gt; F[用户输入 devtool]&#10;    F --&gt; G[系统通过 PATH 找到链接]&#10;    G --&gt; H[执行 dist/cli.mjs]\">graph TD\n    A[npm install -g devtool] --&gt; B[读取 package.json]\n    B --&gt; C[获取 bin 字段]\n    C --&gt; D[创建符号链接]\n    D --&gt; E[devtool → dist/cli.mjs]\n    E --&gt; F[用户输入 devtool]\n    F --&gt; G[系统通过 PATH 找到链接]\n    G --&gt; H[执行 dist/cli.mjs]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"shebang-行\">Shebang 行</h2><p><strong>Shebang</strong>（<code>#!</code>）是 Unix 系统用来指定脚本解释器的机制。Node.js CLI 脚本的第一行必须包含 shebang。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env node&#10;&#10;import { Command } from &#39;commander&#39;;&#10;&#10;const program = new Command();&#10;&#10;program.name(&#39;devtool&#39;).version(&#39;1.0.0&#39;).description(&#39;全栈开发工具&#39;);&#10;&#10;program&#10;  .command(&#39;init &lt;name&gt;&#39;)&#10;  .description(&#39;初始化新项目&#39;)&#10;  .option(&#39;-t, --template &lt;template&gt;&#39;, &#39;项目模板&#39;, &#39;default&#39;)&#10;  .action((name: string, options: { template: string }) =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(`初始化项目: ${name} (模板: ${options.template})`);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;program.parse();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Command } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'commander'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> program</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">program.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'devtool'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'全栈开发工具'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">program</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'init &#x3C;name>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'初始化新项目'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-t, --template &#x3C;template>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'项目模板'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'default'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">template</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`初始化项目: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} (模板: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">options</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">template</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">})`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">program.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Shebang</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>#!/usr/bin/env node</code></td>\n<td>通过 env 查找 node</td>\n<td>推荐，兼容性最好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#!/usr/bin/node</code></td>\n<td>固定路径</td>\n<td>不推荐，路径可能不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#!/usr/bin/env -S node --experimental-vm-modules</code></td>\n<td>传递参数</td>\n<td>需要特殊 Node 标志</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>#!/usr/bin/env node</code> 而不是硬编码 Node.js 路径，因为不同系统上 Node.js 的安装位置可能不同。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"esm-脚本组织\">ESM 脚本组织</h2><p>现代 Node.js CLI 工具应使用 <strong>ESM</strong>（ECMAScript Modules）模块系统，配合 TypeScript 获得类型安全。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// src/cli.ts - 入口文件&#10;#!/usr/bin/env node&#10;&#10;import { createCommand } from &#39;./commands/index.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;const program = createCommand();&#10;program.parse();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/cli.ts - 入口文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">#</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">usr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createCommand } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './commands/index.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> program</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><s